+## Board and decomposition audit
+
+No element or planning artifact was created. The existing smallest atomic owner
+set still covers policy, board/spec validation, Apple/Core/relay build gates,
+supply chain, versioning, orchestration, evidence, and adversarial verification.
+The exact spec omissions filled by the contract remain retention values,
+environment names, endpoint allowlists, and conditional SARIF scope; §9 records
+their justification and out-of-scope audit. No research question remains open.
